<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = 6.40%				    O/N = -----</p>
<p>	    T/N = -----				    T/N = 6.38%</p>
<p>		   Aug 30, 1996			 Aug 29, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  7.50%	1 month forward =  7.83%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  9.38%	2 month forward =  9.86%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.66%	3 month forward =  9.98%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  9.97%	4 month forward = 10.38%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 10.84%	5 month forward = 11.09%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.90%	6 month forward = 11.02%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
